 (0)  INPUT SOURCE FILE-A ; OUTPUT RESULT FILE-B ; HSP B .
 (1)  REWIND A STOP .
 (2)  TEST QTY (A) AGAINST 100 ; IF EQUAL GO TO OPERATION 4 ; IF GREATER GO TO OPERATION 3 ;
     OTHERWISE GO TO OPERATION 4 .
 (3)  MOVE QTY (A) TO QTY (B) ; WRITE-ITEM B ; JUMP TO OPERATION 4 .
 (4)  .
 (5)  CLOSE-OUT FILES A ; B .
 (6)  STOP . (END)
